flowchart TD
    Intent([Stage 0: Intent and success criteria]) --> Model[Stage 0.5: Mermaid model first]
    Model --> Inventory[Select approved source or maintained card snapshot]
    Inventory --> MCP[Read-only NotebookLM MCP for source refresh<br/>shared URL allowlist]
    Inventory --> Reference[Stage 1: Reference guide and selected context]
    MCP --> Reference
    Reference --> Plan[Stage 2: Build plan and task graph<br/>role / lens / ownership / evidence]
    Plan --> Review[Stage 3: Independent adversarial review<br/>existing review gates retained]
    Review --> Mode{Approval mode selected by user}
    Mode -->|Human-led| Human[Human reviews each required decision]
    Mode -->|Council-led| Council[Engineering Council and/or Design Council<br/>eligible reviewers use advisory cards]
    Council --> Vote{Quorum and strict majority vote<br/>recorded without critical dissent?}
    Vote -->|Yes| Decision[Record proposal hash, votes and rationale]
    Vote -->|No or tie| Blocked([BLOCKED: revise or escalate])
    Human --> Decision
    Decision --> HardStop{HARD_STOP: security, privacy, legal,<br/>production, credentials, external data,<br/>scope or success criteria change?}
    HardStop -->|Yes| HumanOverride[Explicit Human approval required]
    HardStop -->|No| Authority[Stage 4: Content-hashed authority]
    HumanOverride --> Authority
    Authority --> Topology{Approved task topology}
    Topology -->|Single| Single[Stage 5: One agent, bounded task]
    Topology -->|Parallel| Lanes[Stage 5: Independent lanes<br/>isolated workspaces and owned files]
    Single --> Verify[Stages 6-6.5: Actual checks and receipts]
    Lanes --> Verify
    Verify --> Integrate[Stage 7: One integrator<br/>combined checks and runbook]
    Integrate --> Learn[Stage 8: Retrospective and prevention]
    Learn --> Done([Complete with evidence])
    Verify -->|Failed gate| Blocked
    Integrate -->|Conflict or failed check| Blocked
    Cards[Selected Hero Lenses<br/>advisory throughout the lifecycle] -.-> Plan
    Cards -.-> Review
    Cards -.-> Single
    Cards -.-> Lanes
    Cards -.-> Verify
    Cards -.-> Learn
    Standalone[Standalone council use] --> Host[Host instructions and approval policy]
    Cards -.-> Host
    classDef gate fill:#fff3cd,stroke:#8a6d3b,color:#000;
    classDef stop fill:#f8d7da,stroke:#842029,color:#000;
    class Mode,Vote,HardStop,Topology gate;
    class Blocked stop;
